      <p style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-4);">Those rows use a fixed example. To put your own order volume and branch count through it, the <a href="/make-vs-zapier-cost-calculator/" style="color:var(--g);text-decoration:underline;">Make vs Zapier cost calculator</a> returns the exact monthly and annual difference for your store.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:16px;">
        <a href="/go/make/" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="btn-green" style="font-size:14px;padding:12px 24px;">Start free on Make.com — 1,000 ops/month →</a>
