  <!-- SHOPIFY FLOW / THREE-WAY -->
  <section class="alt-bg">
    <div class="inner-sm">
      <div class="tag">Three-way comparison</div>
      <h2 id="flow-h">Make.com vs Zapier vs Shopify Flow</h2>
      <p>Shopify Flow gets listed alongside the other two as though it is a third option. It is a different category of tool, and treating it as an alternative is the most common mistake in this decision.</p>

      <div style="overflow-x:auto;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:24px;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;">
          <thead>
            <tr style="background:var(--bg-3);">
              <th style="padding:12px 18px;text-align:left;color:var(--text-4);font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">On the free plan</th>
              <th style="padding:12px 18px;text-align:center;color:var(--text-4);font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">Make.com</th>
              <th style="padding:12px 18px;text-align:center;color:var(--text-4);font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">Zapier</th>
              <th style="padding:12px 18px;text-align:center;color:var(--text-4);font-family:monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">Shopify Flow</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
